Upload your musics here. There are 2 options to add musics to your Mindustry.
1. Rename the file of the music into one of these pre existing musics:
   * menu
   * launch
   * editor
   * game1
   * game2
   * game3
   * game4
   * game5
   * game6
   * game7
   * game8
   * game9
   * boss1
   * boss2
   Mindustry will automatically replace the corresponding musics with your preferred musics.
2. With JavaScript
   If you have a shit ton of musics you want to be added to your Mindustry, go to the scripts/main.js branch of this repository, continue the guide there.
